# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# `mask`: show what is beneath ONLY where this layer is bright. The colour
# comes from one pattern (a swirling soap film), the shape from another (the
# rings of raindrops on a pond) — rainbow light caught in the ripples. The
# ramp on the mask is a contrast curve: a 10 % floor keeps the film faintly
# there between the rings, and mid-grey is already fully open.
S - Rainbow Ripples
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Soap film
I @pat/soap-2d
C sliderPalette 65536
L pat 0 0 0 0 mask 100 none fill 1
N Ripples
I @pat/raindrops-2d
C sliderMode 65536
C sliderDropsPerSecond 327680
R 100 0:1a1a1a 90:ffffff
